Package: databentoR
Title: R Client for the 'Databento' Historical Market Data API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Sebastian", "Stöckl", , "sebastian.stoeckl@uni.li",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Access the 'Databento' historical market data HTTP API
    <https://databento.com> from R: cost previews, metadata, and
    streaming range requests returned as tibbles or written to
    'parquet' files. Mirrors the interface of the official 'Python'
    client ('metadata.get_cost', 'timeseries.get_range', ...) without
    requiring 'Python' or the binary 'DBN' format, by using the CSV
    encoding of the HTTP API.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/sstoeckl/databentoR
BugReports: https://github.com/sstoeckl/databentoR/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    arrow,
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    tibble
